// circular-masked with ORIGINAL colors preserved (no luminance ramp — the old
// ramp washed out the gamepad purple). Outline glyphs use a STEEP luminance
// -> alpha curve (cores fully opaque, tight edges). Smiley stays baked WHITE
// (it sits on the always-dark Say pill). Calendar + speaker are BLACK glyphs
// so code recolors them per theme via tintColor (dark on light themes, light
// — or sampled gold #D0A010 for the speaker — on dark themes).
//
// Premium game icon (boss 2026-10-27 19:50, replaces the old purple gamepad
// slice above — the purple pixels are GONE, BOTTOM_GAMEPAD now holds the new
// art): deep-dark glossy controller silhouette on a #252525-family dark disc
